# Possessor of a Precious Soul - 3 (Q246), refused: a level 76 human Gladiator playing its base
# class, holding Caradine's first letter, is turned away by Caradine, who takes subclasses only,
# and the quest is not started. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q246_possessor_of_a_precious_soul_base_class.golden
character Fighter 76
class 2
hold 7678 1
script quest.Q246_PossessorOfAPreciousSoul
item 7678
page default/31740.htm
page script/quest/Q246_PossessorOfAPreciousSoul/
npc caradine 31740 Folk 10 0 0

# Caradine turns away a character playing its base class, letter in hand.
action caradine
action caradine
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=caradine item=0 page=default/31740.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{caradine}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=caradine item=0 page=script/quest/Q246_PossessorOfAPreciousSoul/31740-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  state Q246_PossessorOfAPreciousSoul CREATED
  rows Q246_PossessorOfAPreciousSoul -
